> a(x: u64) = x << 64
> b(x: u64) = x << 65
> c(x: u64) = x << 1010
> d(x: u64) = x >> 64
> e(x: u64) = x << -1
> f(x: u8) = x << 64
> g(x: u64) = x * (1 << 63)
> h(x: u64) = (x << 63) >> 63
> range a
range of a -> u64:
  empty (undefined everywhere)
  undefined at 65536 points
  sampled 65536 points (domain has 2^64 or more points); not exhaustive
> range d
range of d -> u64:
  empty (undefined everywhere)
  undefined at 65536 points
  sampled 65536 points (domain has 2^64 or more points); not exhaustive
> equiv a b
a and b: vacuously equal: the domain has no points to compare
> equiv e f
e and f: vacuously equal: the domain has no points to compare
